{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main8030_grass_01",
      "hash": "1e8b06f7cbd8b52e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "您好……\\n天氣真好呢。"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main8030_grass_06",
      "hash": "1e8b09f7cbd8ba47",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "真舒服……\\n……呼……呼～"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main8030_grass_07",
      "hash": "1e8b08f7cbd8b894",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……哎呀，真是的。\\n竟然睡著了……"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main8030_grass_08",
      "hash": "1e8afff7cbd8a949",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "歡迎您來到這裡。\\c\\n我是玉虹道館的莉佳。"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main8030_grass_09",
      "hash": "1e8afef7cbd8a796",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我的興趣是插花，\\n寶可夢也都是草屬性。"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main8030_grass_10",
      "hash": "1e8781f7cbd59d58",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……哎呀，真是的。\\n您是要來跟我對戰嗎？"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main8030_grass_11",
      "hash": "1e8782f7cbd59f0b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "是嗎……\\n我可是不會輸的。"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_gymleader_04_02",
      "hash": "9fa9f03d0017d7d3",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 7]"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main8030_grass_02",
      "hash": "1e8b05f7cbd8b37b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我得把這彩虹徽章給您呢。"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_main8030_sys_01",
      "hash": "f9a1db8ce14fe26f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]從莉佳那裡\\n得到了[VAR COLOR(0006)]彩虹徽章[VAR COLOR(0000)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_main8030_grass_03",
      "hash": "1e8b04f7cbd8b1c8",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "有了彩虹徽章，\\n即使自己不是初訓家，\\r\\n等級[VAR NUM2(0004)]以下的寶可夢\\r\\n都會乖乖聽您的話。\\c\\n還有……\\n您要是不嫌棄的話，\\r\\n也請一定要用用這個！"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_main8030_sys_02",
      "hash": "f9a1dc8ce14fe422",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]從莉佳那裡\\n得到了[VAR ITEM2(0001)]\\r\\n「[VAR COLOR(0006)][VAR MOVE(0002)][VAR COLOR(0000)]」！"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_main8030_grass_04",
      "hash": "1e8b0bf7cbd8bdad",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "招式學習器53\\n的內容是「超級吸取」。\\c\\n這個優秀的招式能把\\n給予對手傷害的一半，\\r\\n轉化為寶可夢的營養。"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_main8030_grass_05",
      "hash": "1e8b0af7cbd8bbfa",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "哎呀呀……\\n您在收集圖鑑呀，\\r\\n真是了不起。\\c\\n換做是我的話，\\n就只會去收集美麗的寶可夢呢。"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_main_event_8030_max",
      "hash": "fc62f3cac814518c"
    }
  ]
}
